ic financial markets, facilitating capital raising for businesses.^Currency Value Influence: Inflows and outflows of FPI can significantly impact the value of a country’s currency in the foreign exchange market.^Resilience to Economic Shocks: Diverse sources of FPI can offer some level of resilience against economic downturns and external financial shocks."},{"question":"How to interpret the Gross Foreign Portfolio Investment (FPI) data?","answer":"$2a"}],"related":[{"slug":"baltic-dry-index","title":"Baltic Dry Index"},{"slug":"crude-oil-price-indian-basket","title":"Crude Oil Price (Indian Basket)"},{"slug":"external-commercial-borrowings-ecbs","title":"External Commercial Borrowings (ECBs)"},{"slug":"foreign-exchange-reserves","title":"Foreign Exchange Reserves"},{"slug":"foreign-tourist-arrivals","title":"Foreign Tourist Arrivals"},{"slug":"gross-foreign-direct-investment-fdi","title":"Gross Foreign Direct Investment (FDI)"},{"slug":"import-cover-months","title":"Import Cover (Months)"},{"slug":"international-air-passenger-traffic","title":"Air Passenger Traffic - International"},{"slug":"non-oil-exports","title":"Non-Oil Exports"},{"slug":"port-cargo-traffic","title":"Port Cargo Traffic"},{"slug":"services-trade-net-inflows","title":"Services Trade- Net Inflows"}],"title":"Gross Foreign Portfolio Investment (FPI)","description":"Gross FPI inflows into India stand at $ 4,371 Million for Jul 2026. This is a useful complement to net FPI figures when reading appetite for Indian assets.","headline":{"Absolute":"Gross FPI inflows into India stand at $ 4,371 Million for Jul 2026. This is a useful complement to net FPI figures when reading appetite for Indian assets."},"source":"CMIE Economic Outlook, 1 Finance Research","source_url":"https://economicoutlook.cmie.com/","date_modified":"2026-07-01","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T22:51:21+00:00"}